        <Param val="Welcome to the experiment!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will be presented with two rectangles. On each trial you will see a fixation cross followed by a brief cue. After a short delay a small black star target may appear at one end of a rectangle. Press the &quot;UP&quot; arrow key when you see the black star. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Important:&amp;#10;On some trials no target will appear. If you do not see a target, do not press any key. Try to be as fast and accurate as possible &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We will start with a short practice block followed by the main experiment.&amp;#10;Press &quot;SPACEBAR&quot; to start the practice block." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
